WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:04.710
It's been one week since you 
began attending this school.

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:08.610
As planned, you'll be visiting and 
observing the various clubs today.

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:13.850
At this school, students are 
required to participate in a club,

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:18.030
so make sure to visit a variety of clubs 
and choose the one that's right for you.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:19.490
Got it?

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:20.510
Yes, ma'am!

00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:57.010
<b>#3  Let's Start a Girls Cycling Club!</b>

00:01:53.430 --> 00:01:54.420
Hey, hey, hey!

00:01:54.870 --> 00:01:57.010
You won't get past us easily.

00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:59.230
What will you do, first-year?

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:04.220
Tomo-chan, please!

00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:08.990
That wasn't a pass, that was a shot.

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:12.770
Akizuki-san, rebound!

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:13.900
What?

00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:20.070
Tomo-chan?

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:22.570
Akizuki-san, are you okay?

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:25.880
Ouch...

00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:27.920
Are you okay, Tomo-chan?

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:29.750
Yeah, I think so.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:33.000
I don't think the basketball 
team's right for us.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:34.000
<b>Basketball Team</b>

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:34.000
<b>Gym A</b>

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.000
Yeah.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:37.100
I'm not very athletic.

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:38.940
I'm especially bad at ball sports.

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:42.310
It's like a cultural festival.

00:02:42.310 --> 00:02:44.970
Looks like the cultural clubs
 mostly meet inside the school.

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:48.480
The art club, the literature club,
 the woodwinds club...

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:51.060
Huh? What's the adventure club?

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:51.960
Welcome to the Cosplay Club

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:53.650
The cosplay club and rocket club?

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:53.650
<b>Rocket Club</b>

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:57.660
There are a lot of clubs with funny names.

00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:00.570
Apparently, our school will accept 
almost anything as a club,

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:03.660
so long as you can gather enough members.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.090
Really?

00:03:05.090 --> 00:03:08.390
But since the number of clubs 
has increased due to that,

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:11.710
the competition to recruit members is fierce.

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:14.440
Everyone puts a lot of effort 
into recruiting new members.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:16.110
Huh...

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:21.340
Hey, want to check out the 
light swimming club next?

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:21.340
<b>Light Swimming Club</b>

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:21.340
<b>Indoor Pool</b>

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:24.250
What? Another athletic club?

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:29.020
Yeah. We'll have an easier time later if 
we visit our least favorite clubs first.

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:31.810
I see. Tomo-chan, you're so smart.

00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:37.900
Hiromi, I bet you wait until the last 
minute to do your summer homework.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:40.240
What? How did you know?

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:51.960
Wow, this is the indoor pool?

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.670
They've got everything.

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:57.640
Look, there's a bath.

00:03:57.640 --> 00:03:59.140
That's a Jacuzzi.

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:02.710
It looks like there's a 
sauna over there, too.

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:04.090
A sauna?

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:11.060
It's a room where the temperature is 
set high, so you can warm yourself up.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:14.400
Wow, it's kind of gorgeous.

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:19.210
These two lanes are the
 light swimming club's territory.

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:21.500
Feel free to swim in there.

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:23.630
We can't go on the other side?

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:27.490
It's not that you can't, but those 
are the swim team's practice lanes.

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:32.680
What's the difference between the 
light swimming club and the swim team?

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:33.940
Well...

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:38.680
The swim team is a serious athletic 
team that aims for first place.

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:40.410
But that's not really our thing.

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:44.650
I guess we're just a group of people 
who want to enjoy swimming.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:46.900
So even if you're not a good swimmer...

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:48.430
Yeah, no problem.

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:53.230
We have a few members who 
just like being in the water.

00:04:56.280 --> 00:04:57.880
It's so warm.

00:04:57.880 --> 00:04:59.520
It's a heated pool.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:02.180
Tomo-chan, I'm going on ahead.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:11.700
That's a weird way to swim.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:10.910
Here I go!

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:13.120
Could it be?

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:26.680
She's just walking!

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:28.580
Maybe I'll join her.

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:36.210
You can't catch me.

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:40.540
Hiromi!

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:49.590
Are you okay, Maiharu-san?

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:50.910
That voice...

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:52.730
Higa-san.

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:53.870
Thanks for the other day.

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:55.860
Hiromi, are you okay?

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:57.660
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:05:57.660 --> 00:05:58.170
Ow...

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:00.580
Okay, all done.

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:04.100
It's just a little scrape, 
so it should heal soon.

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:06.000
Thank you.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:07.420
And thanks, Higa-san.

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:10.930
It's fine. I'm glad it wasn't serious.

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:15.350
I didn't notice at all that 
you were in the pool, too.

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:18.130
Apparently, she was underwater the whole time.

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:19.100
The whole time?

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:20.990
Yeah, for about two minutes.

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:22.230
Two minutes?

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:27.440
I could've stayed under longer, 
but I was told not to.

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:29.450
Wow, that's amazing.

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:32.440
I used to go diving all the time 
in Okinawa, so I'm good at it.

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:33.580
But...

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:37.560
It sucks that the pool's too 
small to swim around in freely.

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:41.890
And there aren't any fish,
and the scenery's always the same.

00:06:43.020 --> 00:06:45.850
Higa-san, you're from Okinawa?

00:06:45.850 --> 00:06:48.500
What's Okinawa like?

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:52.260
I lived on a remote island, 
so everyone was laid back.

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:54.580
Were there lots of tasty things to eat?

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:58.480
Yeah. I liked the champloo.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:02.090
Champloo? Like with goya melon?

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:02.940
Hey.

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:06.820
Keep your voices down in the nurse's office.

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:08.980
Oh, it's Fuyune-san.

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:11.070
So it is you girls.

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:14.700
What are you doing in the 
nurse's office, Fuyune-san?

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.180
Are you not feeling well?

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:19.570
No, I'm not. I'm so unwell, I can't walk.

00:07:19.570 --> 00:07:20.450
What?

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:22.690
What are you talking about, Kamikura-san?

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:25.410
Your muscles are just sore.

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:30.060
You're sore?

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:32.050
That's right.

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:38.670
My leg is cramping!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.730
Ouch.

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:44.220
Can't you do something about this?

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:46.140
Try stretching your leg.

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:47.930
Hey, don't touch me!

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:50.900
But this'll make it get better faster.

00:07:51.390 --> 00:07:52.330
Here we go.

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:57.810
Ow!

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:02.700
Ouch...

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:06.340
Sorry, but I'm dropping out here.

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:14.090
I didn't think biking to 
Enoshima would be so hard.

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:15.760
Are you girls really fine?

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:17.290
Yeah.

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:20.150
That was hardly a workout.

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.700
You're all tough, aren't you?

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:25.770
Fuyune-san, I think you're just too dainty.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.820
I've applied a compress,

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:31.180
so now you just need to loosen 
your muscles by walking around.

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:34.280
You're still in the middle 
of visiting clubs, right?

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:37.160
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:37.160
Thank you.

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:39.740
What should we do now?

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:42.450
I've looked at most of the athletic clubs.

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:46.870
We were thinking of visiting 
some cultural clubs next.

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:48.690
Fuyune-san, what about you?

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:51.550
I have somewhere to be.

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:54.300
I know. Why don't you join me?

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:05.190
That's odd. They said it was this way.

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:09.530
This school has been remodeling 
since before the war,

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:12.310
so the layout is pretty complicated.

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:14.710
Hey, isn't that the way?

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:24.370
Ouch...

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:27.660
These stairs are hard on sore muscles.

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:29.780
Are you okay?

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:31.170
I need a break.

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:35.380
Guys, hurry up!

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:43.340
Wow, we're up so high.

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:47.850
It's a house.

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:53.100
Excuse me! Is anybody home?

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:58.610
That's odd. We were supposed 
to meet here after school.

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:03.980
Are you sure we can go in?

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:07.210
It's fine. We agreed to meet here.

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:13.050
There's someone inside.

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:16.260
Um, hello?

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:32.100
I-Is she dead?

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:42.570
Sorry for scaring you.

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:47.970
You should stop sleeping 
like you're dead, grandmother.

00:10:47.970 --> 00:10:52.440
This little birdbrain was 
about to call an ambulance.

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:57.450
But she wasn't moving at all!

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:03.650
Anyway, Fuyune-san, I didn't know you 
were the principal's granddaughter.

00:11:03.650 --> 00:11:07.640
That's right. Kamikura Ryuko 
is my paternal grandmother

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:11.140
and the principal of 
Minami Kamakura High School.

00:11:11.140 --> 00:11:12.590
I think she's...

00:11:12.590 --> 00:11:14.270
I'm the third generation.

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:18.150
Have some coffee.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.660
Thank you.

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:22.190
Fuyune, I made tea for you.

00:11:22.190 --> 00:11:22.740
Thanks.

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:25.900
I'll leave some for you two, too.

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:27.330
Okay.

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:31.290
Fuyune-san, what is this place?

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:33.850
My grandmother's hideout, I guess.

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:39.150
She promised to show me once I started 
attending Minami Kamakura High School.

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:40.880
Her hideout?

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:50.920
I'd heard about it,
but this place seems nice.

00:11:52.150 --> 00:11:55.450
I have a kitchen where 
I can prepare simple meals.

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:57.200
And more than anything,

00:11:57.200 --> 00:12:01.330
it's quiet, so it's the perfect environment 
for listening to music and reading.

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:03.030
Tomo-chan...

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:06.700
Look! There are lots of pictures of bicycles.

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:07.810
Bicycles?

00:12:12.100 --> 00:12:13.890
Cape Erimo?

00:12:13.890 --> 00:12:16.170
Trip around Hokkaido?

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:20.570
The Minami Kamakura High School Cycling Club?

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:22.840
This picture looks pretty old.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.760
I wonder when it was taken.

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:27.930
'74?

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:31.150
'74? Like, 1974?

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:33.780
We weren't even born yet.

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:37.020
Does that mean these pictures 
are more than 40 years old?

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:41.900
40 years? Bicycles have 
been around that long?

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:42.990
What?

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:52.310
I've seen this face before.

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:00.390
This is Grandmother!

00:13:00.390 --> 00:13:02.920
What? It's the principal?

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:10.970
This brings back memories.

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:14.350
This picture was taken when 
we biked around Hokkaido.

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:15.940
This one's from Hakone.

00:13:16.710 --> 00:13:19.380
In the south, we visited 
Sakurajima in Kagoshima.

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:22.790
In Shikoku, we crossed the 
mountains from Ehime into Kochi.

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:27.690
In Noto, we saw a festival, 
and we went to Tohoku, too.

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:32.310
These are all pictures from 
when I attended this school and

00:13:32.310 --> 00:13:36.620
traveled all over with the cycling club.

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:39.260
The cycling club? What's that?

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:41.730
I've never heard of that club.

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:44.270
There was one a long time ago.

00:13:44.270 --> 00:13:47.880
And this was our club room.

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:49.550
Here?

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:59.820
When I was in high school, traveling across
Japan by bike was all the rage.

00:13:59.820 --> 00:14:01.490
Really?

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:06.280
It was a long time ago, so it's 
no wonder you don't know about it.

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:10.910
This bike's a little 
different from a road bike.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:13.830
Yes, that's a randonneur.

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:22.000
It's a touring bike with a rack for lots 
of luggage, splash guards, and lights.

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:29.010
Back then, some of the roads 
were still unpaved,

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:31.460
and of course there weren't
 any convenience stores,

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:35.240
so touring itself felt like an adventure.

00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:42.010
But the sights I saw at the end of 
those long roads were truly beautiful.

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:49.350
The view at the end of a long road...

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:56.540
Hey, Sis. Is there anything I can do for you?

00:14:57.320 --> 00:14:58.600
Well...

00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:01.520
I want to see a view.

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:04.160
A view of someplace far away.

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:05.210
What?

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:11.240
A view you reached by traveling one 
step at a time on your own two feet.

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:22.140
Grandmother, did you invite 
me here to show me this?

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:24.180
Who knows?

00:15:25.490 --> 00:15:30.120
Why was the cycling club disbanded?

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:32.310
It seems so fun.

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:40.460
By the time I graduated, this country 
was entering a period of motorization.

00:15:40.850 --> 00:15:47.130
Cars became commonplace, and highways 
stretched to the corners of the nation.

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:51.990
By the mid-seventies, bullet trains 
had reached all the way to Kyushu,

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:55.680
and airplanes gradually became a more 
familiar mode of transportation.

00:15:56.500 --> 00:15:59.470
The age of speed had arrived.

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:04.150
There are certainly things 
gained through speed.

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:10.510
But I think we also lose 
some things by going fast.

00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:15.660
Apparently, not many people agreed.

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:25.290
Over time, the cycling club lost members 
and eventually, just disappeared.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:32.800
When I became the principal, 
this place was a mess.

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:36.300
It made me sad, so I fixed it up.

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:42.530
Now, I come here sometimes to get 
lost in my memories by myself.

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:48.680
Times change, huh?

00:16:48.680 --> 00:16:51.820
I'm sorry for boring you 
with stories of the past.

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:53.900
I must sound like an old woman.

00:16:55.010 --> 00:16:56.150
Grandmother...

00:16:56.630 --> 00:16:57.510
What?

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:07.190
I could resurrect the club.

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.130
What?

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:11.340
The cycling club.

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:12.920
What?

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:16.750
Riding a bicycle yesterday felt kind of good.

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:19.820
Besides, I went farther 
and faster than I thought I would.

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:22.770
Because of that, I'm sore today, though.

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:28.610
I need to travel far on my own two 
feet and see all kinds of sights.

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:33.440
So I'm going to resurrect the cycling club.

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:38.990
Great! That's a great idea!

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:40.010
Hiromi?

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:41.960
Let's do it, guys.

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:45.100
Tomo-chan, didn't you enjoy riding your bike?

00:17:45.100 --> 00:17:46.950
Yeah, I guess.

00:17:46.950 --> 00:17:48.260
It's decided, then.

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:48.880
What?

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.760
Higa-san, what about you?

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:52.390
What? Sure.

00:17:52.390 --> 00:17:54.420
I have a bike.

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:57.680
And traveling all over 
the place could be fun.

00:17:58.110 --> 00:18:00.010
She's in, too.

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:03.220
Now we have four members, Fuyune-san.

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:04.970
Are you sure?

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:08.540
I was going to gather members myself.

00:18:08.950 --> 00:18:10.700
Yeah, it's fine.

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:15.870
It's true that I enjoyed riding a bike, 
and I do still have to choose a club.

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:19.950
I have a feeling we'll have 
lots of fun with these members.

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:23.500
That's great, Fuyune-san.

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:27.160
The new cycling club has been formed.

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:30.820
Oh, my. I have new juniors.

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:32.390
How delightful.

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:36.360
But I don't think you need to 
limit yourselves to cycling.

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:37.050
What?

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:40.930
There are all kinds of ways 
to enjoy bicycles, right?

00:18:41.340 --> 00:18:42.320
